title: "Certified Interface Aliases: Exact Collisions in Vision-Language Preprocessing, and When They Exist"
abstract: "AliasForge constructs image pairs with opposite correct answers that reach a vision-language model as bit-identical tensors, and certifies them. Code, per-item records and analysis scripts for the paper."
